WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.930 --> 00:00:08.290
This year, Singles Day kicked off with a colorful
gala complete with excited fans, customers

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:11.510
and a live tally of incoming sales.

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:16.120
The 1-billion-dollar-mark fell after a mere
85 seconds.

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:19.870
After an hour, sales had reached 10 billion
dollars.

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:26.490
By the end of the day, revenue at online giant
Alibaba clocked in at 30.8 billion dollars

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:29.050
- a new record.

00:00:29.050 --> 00:00:34.300
"'Singles Day shopping festival has reached
its tenth year.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:40.380
It means not only discounts, but also appreciation.

00:00:40.380 --> 00:00:47.380
I want sellers to show their gratitude to
consumers with the best products and the best

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:50.120
prices..."

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:51.950
Among the sellers were many global players.

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:52.950
Even Apple, which is usually unwilling to
do discounts.

00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:58.090
All in all, some 180,000 brands participated
in the consumer frenzy.

00:00:58.090 --> 00:01:04.550
Alibaba hopes even more companies will begin
participating -- bringing even higher revenues.

00:01:04.550 --> 00:01:09.930
"To be honest, I have been wondering about
the future of Singles' Day.

00:01:09.930 --> 00:01:12.020
Many people are asking me about this, too.

00:01:12.020 --> 00:01:17.790
I would like to say the future of Singles'
Day will see revenues of 200 billion renmimbi,

00:01:17.790 --> 00:01:19.680
and then we'll make changes as we go along.

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:25.390
I think we can bring it to 300 billion, 500
billion and even 1 trillion renmimbi."

00:01:25.390 --> 00:01:27.650
The sky's the limit.

00:01:27.650 --> 00:01:31.150
Though at the moment, feet should remain firmly
on the ground.

00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:35.820
With a general slowdown in the Chinese economy,
revenue growth has slowed from 40 percent

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:38.499
last year to 27 percent this year.

